@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@userId = jlucas1028@aol.com

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Admin counts check
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/event-reminder-counts

### SMS test by userId (uses saved mobile number)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/test-reminder-sms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### SMS test by direct phone number
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/test-reminder-sms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+17325474920",
  "message": "Hello World"
}
